# Muse Agent Notes Log

## Directive to Myself (and Any Future Muse Session)

> **CRITICAL RULE**: Never delete, overwrite, truncate, or rewrite prior notes in this file. Always **append** new notes below existing entries. Prefix every entry with an explicit ISO 8601 timestamp of the form `[YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS+TZ]`.
>
> This file is the Muse-side twin of `grok.ai` / `gemini.ai`. All three are append-only. Do not merge, compact, or clean up any of them.
> Do not create, edit, or delete any other file outside explicitly authorized scope (see `AGENTS.md` section 1). This session is **read-only on code** until the user grants permission.

How to append:

1. `date -Iseconds` for the timestamp.
2. Add a `---` rule, then `## [timestamp] - Short title`.
3. Write what changed, what was observed (not assumed), and what is still open.
4. Save. Do not edit lines above the new heading.

