### What the project is

Khoros Engine: pure ISO C23 (`-std=c23`, `-Wall -Wextra -Wpedantic -Werror=vla`), Linux 7.2+ only. Raw `io_uring` syscalls (no liburing, no epoll/poll), pure Vulkan 1.4 Dynamic Rendering + Sync2 + BDA via push constants (no libwayland, no OpenGL/EGL/GLFW), Slang shaders compiled with `slangc` to SPIR-V 1.6. Dual-ring topology: Core 0 / Ring A (presentation + Wayland), Core 1 / Ring B (ingest + compute), `IORING_OP_MSG_RING` streams 64-bit `VkDeviceAddress` across cores.

Governing docs: `ORIGINAL_REQUEST.md` (R1 Vulkan core, R2 DMA-BUF + DRM syncobj, R3 io_uring Wayland XDG lifecycle, R4 dual-thread topology + acceptance criteria), `AGENTS.md` (permission discipline, append-only logs, C23 bans, subsystem bans), `DEVELOPER.md`, `GITHUB.md` (atomic per-file commits, never commit build/logs/binaries/secrets), `TEST_INFRA.md` / `TEST_READY.md`, `doc/` manuals (12 files).

