- `src/wayland/` + `include/khoros/wayland/` — `wire.c` (header/u32/i32/string encode-decode, memcpy unaligned-safe, NUL + overflow guards), `client.c` (427 lines: pure io_uring direct-socket connect on `KHR_DIRECT_SLOT_WAYLAND = 1`, FIXED_FILE send/recv, multishot RECVMSG inbound tier 0/1, SENDMSG skip-success + NOP barrier, bounded 2000 ms roundtrip, direct close; `KHR_DIRECT_SLOT_INGEST = 0` kept distinct).
